  n<// shifted up and a custom linker script will therefore> u<304> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<5796> s<305> f<1> l<170:1> el<170:56>
  n<// be required by the GCC compiler.> u<305> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<5796> s<306> f<1> l<171:1> el<171:36>
  n<//-------------------------------------------------------> u<306> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<5796> s<307> f<1> l<172:1> el<172:58>
